ecific role. Show why you're excited and what you want to contribute."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-neutral-500 text-sm mt-2 italic","children":"\"I'm excited about this role because I want to apply my growth experience to a larger platform and help millions of users solve real problems.\""}]]}]]}]
